<title>SINGAPORE: Sembawang Corp forms new Hong Kong unit.</title>
<headline>Sembawang Corp forms new Hong Kong unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sembawang Corp Ltd said on Monday its subsidiary Sembawang Express Pte Ltd has formed Sembawang Express (HK) Ltd to engage in freight forwarding and logistics businesses.</p>
<p>The new company has an initial paid-up capital of two ordinary shares of Hong Kong $10 each.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
